Material Symbols / Material Icons
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files:      public/assets/icons/*.png
            public/assets/icons/material/*.svg
Origin:     Google Fonts — https://fonts.google.com/icons
Copyright:  Copyright (C) Google LLC
License:    Apache License, Version 2.0 (see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt)

The icon glyphs shipped in public/assets/icons/ are exported from the Google
Material Symbols / Material Icons set. They are used unmodified in shape and
are redistributed under the terms of the Apache License, Version 2.0.

One file in public/assets/icons/ has been changed from its exported form:
book_3s.png is a renamed copy of the "book_3" glyph. Its shape is unchanged.

public/assets/css/styles.css embeds the "arrow_drop_down" glyph as a data URI to
draw the dropdown arrow on select elements, recoloured white. Its path data is
unchanged.

The SVG files in public/assets/icons/material/ are fetched by
scripts/fetch-material-icons.php from the Material Symbols Outlined set at
optical size 24. Their geometry is untouched — the viewBox and every path are
byte-for-byte the upstream ones — while the width and height attributes are
normalised to 48 so the files carry the same intrinsic size as the PNG icons
next to them. The accompanying index.json and tags.json are generated from the
icon metadata published at https://fonts.google.com/metadata/icons.

That directory also carries its own README.txt stating the same origin, licence
and modification next to the files themselves; the script rewrites it on every
run.

